If 'match' is FALSE, then 'log I(Omega,z) = sum_k b_k z^k' (worker's
stated derivation identity) is mathematically WRONG. The graphical b_k
are a continuum-gas cluster formula that does NOT exponentiate to the
LATTICE-gas partition function I(Omega,z). Only the analytic c_k do.
